<resources>
    <string name="act_it_out_help_title">How to play Act It Out</string>
    <string name="act_it_out_help_text">One person is the actor. Pass them the device, then they hold the big pad to start. They act out the card without speaking, and everyone else guesses. Tap Correct when someone gets it, or Skip for a new card (three skips each turn). Correct cards score for the actor\'s team, plus a bonus point when the team has the little kids bonus. The most points after the last round wins.</string>
